    <briefdescription>
<para>Finds the drawn record nearest to a pixel position, for series that draw one record per data point. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A spatial grid of the records&apos; data spans along their position axis narrows the candidates, and a pixel distance test picks among them. The spans are rebuilt lazily after <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1RecordHitIndex_1aff62b36c397fbfe6e10fb962eee64197" kindref="member">invalidate()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
